<h1 id="preface">Preface</h1>

<p>In development we’re often bothered by tricky corner-radius problems, especially when we want to round a UIView only at the top-left, bottom-left, etc.</p>

<p>This kind of requirement is well worth implementing in code. Today I happened to find a great article on <a href="https://www.appcoda.com/rounded-corners-uiview/?utm_source=feedburner&amp;utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_campaign=Feed%3A+appcoda+%28AppCoda%3A+Your+iOS+Programming+Community%29">AppCode</a>. Hence the post below.</p>

