<p>This distinguishes the two approaches before and after iOS 11.</p>

<p>Before iOS 11, we drew a path with a Bezier curve, then created a <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">CAShapeLayer</code> to act as a transparent mask on <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">self.layer.mask</code>, to round different corners.</p>

